# Delta: core-S04-room-lifecycle.json

> 提案：fix-canvas-zoom-invite-comment-resize（问题 2：协作邀请链接无效）

## MODIFIED — step 6（Owner 创建 editor 邀请）断言

step 6 的 `expect.json` 中 `inviteUrl` 断言由「仅 `{ "type": "string" }`」改为「类型 + 正则匹配 + 硬编码排除」，并新增 `invite_url` 提取供后续步骤引用。修改后 step 6 完整内容：

```json
    {
      "step_id": 6,
      "name": "Owner 创建 editor 邀请",
      "alignment_step": "S04.2 §4 Step 3–11",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/rooms/${room_id}/invites",
      "request": {
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "Authorization": "Bearer ${owner_token}"
        },
        "body": {
          "role": "editor"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 201,
        "json": {
          "token": { "type": "string" },
          "role": { "equals": "editor" },
          "inviteUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "matches": "^[a-z][a-z0-9+.-]*://[^/]+(:[0-9]+)?/invite/[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$",
            "not_contains": ["localhost", "127.0.0.1"]
          },
          "expiresAt": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "extract": {
        "invite_token": "$.token",
        "invite_url": "$.inviteUrl"
      }
    }
```

> 说明：`matches` 要求 invite_url 为 `{scheme}://{host}(:{port})?/invite/{token}` 形式的完整 URL（host 与编排 `base_url` 一致，含非默认端口）；`not_contains` 断言不含硬编码 localhost / 127.0.0.1。这两个 matcher 沿该 JSON 既有单键断言对象风格扩展为多键组合。
